            <div xml:id="d576">

                <pb facs="0474" n="462" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg462"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00112 European War 1939/5507: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Childs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-19T23:00:00-04:00">May 19, 1942—11
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>98. Your 221, May 15 and 195, May 5. Department is taking up with other
                    interested agencies of this Government the question of making specific proposals
                    to General Orgaz. You may inform him that his note of April 30 is receiving our
                    active consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
